and installed.

1. What you may do

   Free of charge, you may:
   a. use the website and the web app, and download the Android app and the
      browser extension from the official Lentivault download page and
      install them on your own devices and browsers, for your own personal,
      non-commercial use;
   b. use it within a non-commercial group, for example a family, a school
      class, a club or a community, as long as nobody is charged for access
      to Lentivault itself;
   c. export, keep and share your own Lentivault data (for example the CSV or
      JSON exports of your own usage history and settings).

2. What you may not do

