      install, run or visit it yourself;
   b. modify, decompile, reverse engineer or take apart the Software, or make,
      publish or distribute anything based on it (a "derivative work"),
      including a renamed or rebranded version, except to the extent that the
      law where you live allows this despite this restriction (for example for
